  "totalBlocks": 97,
  "translatedBlocks": 76,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d8b507794b9e59b",
      "translationZh": "更新（02/2024）：性能又有了进一步提升！查看我们更新后的基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ece7f6ea3daa672",
      "translationZh": "在此前 Hugging Face 博客的一篇文章中，我们介绍了 AWS Inferentia2，也就是第二代 AWS Inferentia 加速器，并说明了如何使用 optimum-neuron，在 AWS Inferencia 2 实例上快速部署用于标准文本和视觉任务的 Hugging Face 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5189d0b831c75bec",
      "translationZh": "随着与 AWS Neuron SDK 的进一步集成，现在可以使用 🤗 optimum-neuron，在 AWS Inferentia2 上部署用于文本生成的 LLM 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d25e6003091f095d",
      "translationZh": "要做这次演示，还有什么模型比 Llama 2 更合适呢？它是 Hugging Face hub 上最受欢迎的模型之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eeeb811aebd6dc19",
      "translationZh": "在你的 Inferentia2 实例上配置 🤗 optimum-neuron",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab42fb71b610e9e1",
      "translationZh": "我们建议使用 Hugging Face Neuron Deep Learning AMI（DLAMI）。该 DLAMI 已为你预装了所有必需的库，包括 Optimum Neuron、Neuron Drivers、Transformers、Datasets 和 Accelerate。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d90250d3ca5decf",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 Hugging Face Neuron SDK DLC，在 Amazon SageMaker 上进行部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a78af2813f8bfa9b",
      "translationZh": "注意：敬请关注即将发布的专门介绍 SageMaker 部署的文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b81b9f702d9fa106",
      "translationZh": "最后，也可以按照 optimum-neuron 的安装说明，在全新的 Inferentia2 实例上手动安装这些组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a695eb57eacb1ec5",
      "translationZh": "将 Llama 2 模型导出为 Neuron 格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c83d4ea10b80dd69",
      "translationZh": "如 optimum-neuron 文档所述，在 Neuron 设备上运行模型之前，需要先将模型编译并导出为序列化格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36495c5989dc3fc1",
      "translationZh": "幸运的是，🤗 optimum-neuron 提供了一个非常简单的 API，可将标准的 🤗 transformers 模型导出为 Neuron 格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d36b1dd80011ccd",
      "translationZh": "这里值得稍作解释：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2d9277b07076f85",
      "translationZh": "通过 compiler_args，我们指定要将模型部署到多少个核心上（每个 neuron 设备有两个核心），以及使用何种精度（这里是 float16），",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "447d8d77608d845b",
      "translationZh": "通过 input_shape，我们设置模型的静态输入和输出维度。所有模型编译器都要求使用静态形状，neuron 也不例外。请注意，sequence_length 不仅限制输入上下文的长度，还限制 KV 缓存的长度，从而限制输出长度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e3fc539960f5504",
      "translationZh": "根据所选参数和 inferentia 主机的不同，这一过程可能需要几分钟到一个多小时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8291828646f41205",
      "translationZh": "幸运的是，你只需执行一次此操作，因为你可以保存模型，稍后再重新加载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f919d5348a11db1",
      "translationZh": "更棒的是，你可以将它推送到 Hugging Face hub。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2ea8cbab4331364c",
      "translationZh": "在 AWS Inferentia2 上使用 Llama 2 生成文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "471b13baa5fdd97c",
      "translationZh": "模型导出后，你就可以使用 transformers 库生成文本，具体方法已在之前的这篇文章中详细介绍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3106b411d04abc9",
      "translationZh": "注意：向模型传入多个输入提示词时，所得到的词元序列必须在左侧用流结束词元填充。随导出模型一同保存的分词器已进行了相应配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5240f25973a23501",
      "translationZh": "支持以下生成策略：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f27a14d2fbb17f25",
      "translationZh": "贪心搜索，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cbcebf28b40cd85",
      "translationZh": "结合 top-k 和 top-p 的多项式采样（带温度参数）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9e56f295138a115",
      "translationZh": "支持大多数 logits 预处理操作/过滤器（例如重复惩罚）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0ab33ad5c1cdda8b",
      "translationZh": "使用 optimum-neuron pipelines 实现一体化处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa7a6ef7bcdd6389",
      "translationZh": "对于喜欢保持简单的人来说，使用 optimum-neuron pipelines 是一种在 AWS inferentia 2 上使用 LLM 模型的更简单方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8b41a40eb4370cf",
      "translationZh": "使用它们就是这么简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f2e7732a6956e5b",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "843424147a0a03bd",
      "translationZh": "但在 Inferentia2 上进行文本生成的效率究竟有多高？让我们来一探究竟！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d60f62c2d82c3d7b",
      "translationZh": "我们已在 hub 上上传了采用不同配置的 LLama 2 7B 和 13B 模型的预编译版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2c9a11a72846b34",
      "translationZh": "模型类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9ab95992541afe6",
      "translationZh": "核心数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f95a5db603ac7d1b",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Hub 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01d0afd86deca20f",
      "translationZh": "Llama2 7B - B（预算）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6eaf06f8a1a79fd",
      "translationZh": "Llama2 7B - L（延迟）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b518eb4261624f7a",
      "translationZh": "Llama2 7B - T（吞吐量）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6775257cccec3d65",
      "translationZh": "Llama2 13B - L（延迟）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1de62a3c09f16f3",
      "translationZh": "Llama2 13B - T（吞吐量）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "052577e5814e9059",
      "translationZh": "注意：所有模型均以 2048 的最大序列长度进行编译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b91a13cc6331121",
      "translationZh": "llama2 7B“经济型”模型旨在部署于 inf2.xlarge 实例上，该实例仅有一个 neuron 设备，并具有足够的 CPU 内存来加载模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03a2468f4db62309",
      "translationZh": "所有其他模型在编译时均配置为使用 inf2.48xlarge 实例上全部可用的核心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bd404b84b4dc5c1",
      "translationZh": "注意：有关可用实例的详细信息，请参阅 inferentia2 产品页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2ccc8751e1e7a3f",
      "translationZh": "我们为 llama2 7B 和 llama2 13B 模型创建了两种面向“延迟”优化的配置，它们一次只能处理一个请求，但能以全速运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b93e2364fb6cacc",
      "translationZh": "我们还创建了两种面向“吞吐量”优化的配置，最多可并行处理四个请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66857ac7b8cba5e7",
      "translationZh": "为了评估这些模型，我们从 256 个输入词元开始生成词元，直到总序列长度达到 1024（即分别生成 256、512 和 768 个词元）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15ce3e4078fe1ab9",
      "translationZh": "注意：我们报告了“经济型”模型的数据，但为了提高可读性，未将其纳入图表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "24da7c34a8f11119",
      "translationZh": "编码时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7af3319424a1bda3",
      "translationZh": "编码时间是处理输入词元并生成第一个输出词元所需的时间。这是一个非常重要的指标，因为它对应于以流式方式输出生成词元时，用户直接感受到的延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5591c7a011aac5cd",
      "translationZh": "我们测试了上下文大小逐步增加时的编码时间，256 个输入词元大致对应于典型的问答用法，而 768 个输入词元则更常见于检索增强生成（RAG）用例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e16d151001ecc261",
      "translationZh": "“经济型”模型（Llama2 7B-B）部署在 inf2.xlarge 实例上，而其他模型则部署在 inf2.48xlarge 实例上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "507163a59f67e459",
      "translationZh": "编码时间以秒为单位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0c1cb4cda1985a4",
      "translationZh": "输入词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "047ae31bf7e8b0f7",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，所有已部署的模型都表现出出色的响应速度，即使在长上下文下也是如此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4d734f5f36d1001a",
      "translationZh": "端到端延迟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "771f682829cd45b9",
      "translationZh": "端到端延迟是指序列长度达到 1024 个 token 所需的总时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2430ec6c532c89ee",
      "translationZh": "因此，它包括编码时间和生成时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e16d151001ecc261",
      "translationZh": "“经济型”模型（Llama2 7B-B）部署在 inf2.xlarge 实例上，而其他模型则部署在 inf2.48xlarge 实例上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a303ca6ea14f092",
      "translationZh": "延迟以秒为单位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6176ce28592147f4",
      "translationZh": "新增 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c40f57def4d207ba",
      "translationZh": "部署在高端实例上的所有模型都表现出良好的延迟，即使是那些实际配置为优化吞吐量的模型也是如此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c21737a8ad73632",
      "translationZh": "以“经济型”配置部署的模型延迟明显更高，但仍可接受。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "960bcc4e48b929b8",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf97ea7b6ed3ba4c",
      "translationZh": "我们采用与其他基准测试相同的惯例来评估吞吐量，即用端到端延迟除以输入和输出 token 的总数。换句话说，我们用端到端延迟除以 batch_size * sequence_length，得到每秒生成的 token 数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e16d151001ecc261",
      "translationZh": "“经济型”模型（Llama2 7B-B）部署在 inf2.xlarge 实例上，而其他模型则部署在 inf2.48xlarge 实例上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13c21d9f5ecf8280",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量以 tokens/second 表示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6176ce28592147f4",
      "translationZh": "新增词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fb35c3d88432fc4",
      "translationZh": "同样，部署在高端实例上的模型具有非常出色的吞吐量，即使是针对延迟进行优化的模型也不例外。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1c0ba7be8841c2",
      "translationZh": "“经济型”模型的吞吐量要低得多，但考虑到普通读者的阅读速度约为每秒 5 个单词，对于流式使用场景来说仍然够用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d93f108ca67da6f",
      "translationZh": "我们展示了使用 🤗 optimum-neuron 将 Hugging Face hub 上的 llama2 模型部署到 AWS Inferentia2 上是多么简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4872eee50608ee5a",
      "translationZh": "部署后的模型在编码时间、延迟和吞吐量方面都表现出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "639b56991c9c3990",
      "translationZh": "有意思的是，部署后的模型延迟对批大小并不太敏感，这为将它们部署到可并行处理多个请求的推理端点上铺平了道路。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecc9427e87f3e408",
      "translationZh": "不过，仍有很大的改进空间：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d159a894c5edbb2",
      "translationZh": "在当前实现中，提高吞吐量的唯一方法是增大批大小，但批大小目前受到设备内存的限制。目前正在集成流水线等替代方案，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0161",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29f5e42a71c0c755",
      "translationZh": "固定的序列长度限制了模型编码长上下文的能力。注意力汇聚点是否能成为解决这一问题的可行方案，值得探索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
